<title>USA: CompuServe segregates adult content.</title>
<headline>CompuServe segregates adult content.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuServe Inc said on Wednesday that it had created an online &quot;adult community&quot; by separating adult forum areas, libraries and games from other services.</p>
<p>CompuServe said it will require potential users to create a password and confirm that they are at least 18 years old before they gain access to the new service.</p>
<p>The online accessor added that the adult controls are in addition to parental controls already available.</p>
</text>
